            "status": "active",
            "contribution_type": "revert",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "Cut a short piece of PVC piping and add a retaining ring to each side. Pack it with ground cat litter. Grind some potassium nitrate, then heat it with powdered sugar in a saucepan, stirring frequently. Pack it into the rocket and add more cat litter. Drill a hole through the litter and attach a fuse. Attach a stick to the side, set it in the ground, and light it."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "Cut a short piece of PVC piping and add a retaining ring to each side. Pack it with ground cat litter. Grind some potassium nitrate, then heat it with powdered sugar in a saucepan, stirring frequently. Pack it into the rocket and add more cat litter. Drill a hole through the litter and attach a fuse. Attach a stick to the side, set it in the ground, and light it. This dose not work",
